+        "Section 5, Theorem 1: polynomial many-one reduction from strongly "
+        "NP-complete 4-Partition to K-tiling"
+    ),
+    "reduction_source": "paper_central",
+    "intuition_type": "invariant",
+    "intuition_description": (
