+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the standard four-band pair-sum index plus exact-cover search "
+        "takes O(m^2+E) exact operations; at the provisional hard preset n=240 "
+        "the pair index alone performs 7,200 exact additions/lookups, while the "
+        "cyclic-gap route uses at most n+3=243 exact gap/rotation operations."
+    ),
